# SpyReels Cursor Rules

## SEO + GEO Golden Standard (NEVER VIOLATE)

Before generating any new page, blog post, free tool page, feature page, comparison page, or landing page:

1. Read docs/SEO_GEO_GOLDEN_STANDARD.md FIRST.
2. Apply every rule in that document to the page being built.
3. Run the pre-ship checklist mentally before showing me the diff.
4. If any item is missing, flag it BEFORE generating code.

## Code rules

- pnpm only, never npm
- No em dashes anywhere in code, comments, strings, copy, emails, or output
- One change at a time, show diff, wait for approval
- After every change run: npx tsc --noEmit
- Exact file paths, no guessing
- Commit only when explicitly told

## File creation policy

- New pages: client/src/pages/[PageName].tsx
- New routes: register in client/src/App.tsx
- New blog posts: insert into blog_posts MySQL table via admin or seed script
- Never create files in client/public/ without asking

## New blog publish (always follow)

When publishing or updating a blog post, follow `docs/BLOG_PUBLISH_CHECKLIST.md` end to end: cannibalization check, Golden Standard content, DB fields (`sourceKeyword`, meta, `noIndex`/canonical), `blogRedirects.ts` / `BLOG_RELATED_SLUGS` / homepage `POPULAR_GUIDES` if needed, deploy verify, then GSC request indexing on the canonical URL only.
